  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 404.02 Scope. This part shall apply to the delegation of nursing tasks by all licensees except for those persons exempted by RSA 326-B:43.\n\nSource. #6778, eff 6-26-98; ss by #7741, eff 8-13-02; ss by #8873, eff 4-24-07; ss by #10299, eff 3-22-13; ss by #10571, eff 4-17-14; ss by #11082, eff 4-26-16",
